  "helpSupportAppVersion": "App Version",
  "helpSupportFaqQ1": "How does Somine work?",
  "helpSupportFaqA1": "Somine lets you collect links from Instagram, YouTube, X and other platforms in one place. Add content by tapping share or manually.",
  "helpSupportFaqQ2": "How do I create collections?",
  "helpSupportFaqA2": "Tap the + button in the top right of the Collections tab to create a new collection. You can assign a name and an emoji to your collections.",
  "helpSupportFaqQ3": "What are the Premium features?",
  "helpSupportFaqA3": "Premium removes the collection and item limits and lets you share collections without limits (the free plan includes 5 shares a month). It also unlocks the Hidden Vault (Face ID / Touch ID), the Midnight and Vibe themes and 5 custom app icons. The widget, search, automatic dark mode and the weekly digest are free for everyone.",
  "helpSupportFaqQ4": "Is my data safe?",
  "helpSupportFaqA4": "Your content is stored on our own servers and all traffic between the app and the server is encrypted with HTTPS; Firebase is used only for signing in. Collections you move into the Hidden Vault are not downloaded to your device until you unlock them with Face ID / Touch ID. You can export your data at any time and delete your account permanently from inside the app.",
  "helpSupportFaqQ5": "How do I delete my content?",
  "helpSupportFaqA5": "Long press on a content card to access the delete option. Deleted items are kept in Recently Deleted for 30 days.",
